    "Name": "Toro TR-A-1",
    "Details": "The original prototype of the Toro, the A-1 was based of the primitive Firebee developed by the Cappellan Confederation. It had two SRM-2s which shared a ton of ammunition and a Large Laser. Though it could only manage 64 km/h, the A-1 had more armor protection than the Firebee, with ten and a half tons of Primitive Armor protecting the mech.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.78</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
